Z||000000||Springtyme||09-28-2001||11:03 PM||||Well, after 4 weeks of work I finally finished my project which a lot of you helped me out with pictures and such a while back. I presented it to my college class last night and they loved it. I ship it out to my friend Jason on Monday. He has a server that he's going to post everything that is needed to run the presentaion.<P>You will need Microsoft Power Point, at least 95, I worked with 97 here at home, and 98 at school so all the newer versions work.<P>Also, in order to download it, you will probably need DSL, Cable, T1/2/3 because it is a rather large file. <BR>If you really want to see it and have no hope of downloading it because your connection is like mine and slower than little old people behind the wheels of big ole' Buicks, then just let me know and give me your address and I will burn everything onto a CD and send it out to ya. If there's anything else I can do for anyone, just let me know. I thank you ALL so much for your help!<P>Oh yeah, dont yell at me if I screwed something up! I know some things in there aren't perfect, but they fit together well. =)<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Cheever3000||09-28-2001||11:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> dont yell at me if I screwed something up!<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>There will be no yelling to anyone promoting the Fiero to the outside world!  You tell me if someone yells at you, and I'll send Guido to take them for a little ride.<P>I can't wait to see it.  You got spunk, kid.  We might have to make a position at CFOG-I for a good Public Relations person like you!<P><BR><P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I><BR>Vice President, <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>Classic Fiero Owners Group International</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Springtyme||09-29-2001||02:21 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever3000:<BR><B> You tell me if someone yells at you, and I'll send Guido to take them for a little ride.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Is Guido gonna take them for a ride in a Fiero?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Well I forgot to mention when I said the file size was big, that it's 27 MB's. I'm trying to figure out a way to trim that down, but I don't think it's going to work. Also, for anyone who sends me their name and address, I will be mailing out your CD on Monday when I mail the one out to Jason. If I get any requests after Monday I'll mail them out one day before I go into work.<P>||||reg||1
