Z||000007||Springtyme||09-30-2001||09:23 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Back On Holiday:<BR><B>If your school has cable modem or dsl, upload it from there if you can.  for us out there with high speed, it'll take 5-10 mins to D/L.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My school has T2 I believe, but I don't have the server. Hence the reason for sending it to Jason. He has cable and a server.<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> Originally posted by Skitime:<B><BR>Hey Springtyme, If youare coming to Tech Day next weekend bring a copy along for me and so we can look at it during the day. Thanks</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I can't make it to tech day =( I have to work unfortunately. Also, my dad is a welder and took Eric's Exausht yesterday to take to work with him tomorrow, we should be getting it back sometime next week so I have the feeling that Saturday is going to be spent in the garage finishing up things on the 3800 swap.<P>Maybe I should also mention my email address is partyon247@hotmail.com for those of you who don't know. I don't have the website address yet where it will be, but as soon as I do I will post it. I probably won't have it until Wednesday/Thursday.<P>**EDIT** The original thread that you guys helped me out on is here <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010122.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010122.html</A>   **EDIT**<p>[This message has been edited by Springtyme (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||1
