Z||000009||Springtyme||10-05-2001||04:15 PM||||<B> HERE IT IS!!! </B><BR> <A HREF="http://129.21.132.60/spring/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>http://129.21.132.60/spring/fiero/</A> <P>Is the place to download it from. Now I haven't tried it, but I believe the only file you need to download is the powerpoint project itself. It is the 7th one up form the bottom, the extension on it is .ppt<P>The only thing that might not work on it is the movie, but if none of it works, all the pictures are there for you to download, just keep them all in the same directory and it should work.<P>To the people I mailed it out to, Let me know you got it, and also for you and those who might actually take the time to download it, let me know what you think =)||||reg||4
