Z||000016||Springtyme||10-06-2001||08:17 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85ZainoGT:<BR><B>I received the cd yesterday, thanks    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> but when I put it in the cd rom drive and opened it to see what it had, it just had a fiero folder then an engine folder and had a few pics.. is this right?  I thought it was a presentation, am I missin something    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Inside the Fiero Folder there is a project called "FIERO" I think. Maybe it says "Fiero Presentation" I'm not exactly sure. Click on that, that is the presentation. You have to have Microsoft Power Point in order for it to work. <P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever3000:<BR><B>Awesome!  Good job!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>I don't know PowerPoint, so I can't appreciate the effort involved, but every screen was interesting yet not overdone.  Nice use of the pics, and good entrance effects.  I even liked the background.<BR>All I can say now is: MORE!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>All you really have to do is open up powerpoint and then under "Slide Show" click "View Show" and to make things pop up and to go to the next screen, just hit the space bar. On the screen where it lists the different type of engine swaps, you can use the mouse to click on the "See Pictures" to go see the page and pictures for that one. You click the mouse to go forward through the pics. Then you can click the "back to index button" to go back to the page with the list. =)<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Springtyme (edited 10-06-2001).]||||reg||1
